hook: /doctor:runtime-mirrors, or /doctor:symlink check in a linked project. Unapproved Codex hook: the repair line the check prints, which opens /hooks in a Codex session. Absent Codex advisor entry: the repair line the check prints |\n \n ## 4. Result Templates\n \n ### Summary\n","status":"modified","additions":1,"deletions":1}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited .skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-setup-presentation.txt (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"path\":\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-setup-presentation.txt\",\"oldString\":\"| delivery | Missing hook: /doctor:runtime-mirrors, or /doctor:symlink check in a linked project. Unapproved Codex hook: the repair line the check prints, which opens /hooks in a Codex session |\",\"newString\":\"| delivery | Missing hook: /doctor:runtime-mirrors, or /doctor:symlink check in a linked project. Unapproved Codex hook: the repair line the check prints, which opens /hooks in a Codex session. Absent Codex advisor entry: the repair line the check prints |\"}"},"time":{"start":1794559045391,"end":1794559046581}}}}
